<% content_for :title, "Install Knowledge Vault · Slack" %>
<div class="kv-page">
  <div class="kv-page-header">
    <div class="kv-heading-group">
      <h1>Install Knowledge Vault</h1>
      <p class="kv-page-subtitle">Search your company docs with AI — in this app and in Slack. Sign up here first, then connect your workspace.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="kv-badge-row">
      <div class="kv-pill">
        <span class="kv-pill-dot"></span>
        Slack app · Sign up first
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="kv-install-hero">
    <p class="kv-install-lead">
      <strong>What you can do:</strong> Upload PDFs and docs, then ask questions in plain English. Get answers backed by your own documents. Use it in this app or by mentioning the bot in Slack.
    </p>

    <div class="kv-install-steps-wrapper">
      <p class="kv-steps-heading">How to get started</p>
      <ol class="kv-install-steps">
        <li>
          <span class="kv-step-num">1</span>
          <span><strong>Create an account</strong> — Sign up below. We’ll create your organization and make you the admin.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="kv-step-num">2</span>
          <span><strong>Connect Slack</strong> — Go to Integrations (after login) and connect your Slack workspace so the bot can answer in channels and DMs.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="kv-step-num">3</span>
          <span><strong>Upload docs &amp; ask</strong> — Add documents from the Documents page, then ask questions on the Q&A page or by @mentioning the bot in Slack.</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="kv-install-cta">
      <p class="kv-cta-lead">Create your account to continue</p>
      <%= link_to "Create account", new_user_registration_path, class: "kv-primary-button" %>
      <%= link_to "Log in", new_user_session_path, class: "kv-secondary-button" %>
    </div>

    <p class="kv-meta-text kv-meta-muted kv-install-note">
      Already have a workspace connected? Log in and connect Slack — you’ll be added to your team’s organization automatically.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="kv-soft-divider"></div>
  <p class="kv-meta-text kv-meta-muted">
    Need help? <%= link_to "Support", support_path %> · <%= link_to "Privacy policy", privacy_path %>
  </p>
</div>
